OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl dies on M20 in Kent,
OL,4,Apolice say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl has died overnight on
OL,7,Fthe M20 in Kent.
OL,9,FPolice were called at about 03:20 BST
OL,10,Fto the coastbound carriageway between
OL,11,Fjunctions 4 and 5, near Aylesford.
OL,13,FThe girl, who was on the carriageway in
OL,14,Fthe vicinity of a footbridge near
OL,15,FTeapot Lane, had been struck by
OL,16,Fvehicles, Kent Police said.
OL,18,FShe was confirmed as deceased by police
OL,19,Fand her next of kin have been informed.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
